{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penalty is a 2D open-world fantasy RPG that introduces the 2D fantasy genre in a completely new way, with its unique combat system and innovative mechanics. In this game, the story is the one you create. You can be a beggar on the street, gather fruit in the forest, become a king, or even ascend to godhood. You can rule both heaven and hell, wielding powers you could never have imagined. You may also choose to live as an ordinary worker or merchant, or as someone tending their farm and living in harmony with nature. The choice is entirely in your hands\u2014where you go, when you begin, and how you shape your journey. Whatever path you take, you will have a great time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2853710?t=1772550018","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853710/03db6c9cc16db2a28063daaa476dcbd1eb8f812e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772550018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853710/05a1f64bce3109a43143509ed95708a869995cc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772550018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853710/05a1f64bce3109a43143509ed95708a869995cc3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772550018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descriptio